        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "That's perfect, thank you.\n\nI also added:\n\n```lua\nvim.keymap.set('n', '=P', '<Cmd>exe \"put! \" . v:register<CR>==^', { desc = 'Paste Above and re-indent' })\nvim.keymap.set('n', '=p', '<Cmd>exe \"put \"  . v:register<CR>==^', { desc = 'Paste Below and re-indent' })\n```",
